---
/**
 * A hand-drawn graphite underline in clay, drawn once when the page loads.
 * The path is deliberately uneven; the #graphite filter (Direction.astro)
 * roughens its edge so it reads as pencil rather than as a vector rule.
 * With reduced motion it is simply there.
 */
---

<span class="pencil">
  <slot />
  <svg class="pencil__mark" viewBox="0 0 300 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path pathLength="1" d="M4 15.5 C 46 10.5, 92 17.5, 142 12.5 S 236 9, 296 13.5" />
  </svg>
</span>
